{"id":"daa9bca73e82e3a0","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/121_Δ₀-收集理论.md","title":"121 Δ₀-收集理论","display":"121_Δ₀-收集理论","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;m\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;m\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\to\\mathsf{Var},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\to\\mathsf{Var},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 有限。函数符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0:0,\\qquad S:1,\\qquad +:2,\\qquad \\times:2,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0:0,\\qquad S:1,\\qquad +:2,\\qquad \\times:2,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;:2\">\\(&lt;:2\\)</span>。原始构造子为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul},\n\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{lt},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\">\\(\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul},\n\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{lt},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\)</span>；显示记号不增加构造子。本系统区别于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>-收集理论之处是收集公式类固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与-$\\Delta_0$\">2. 项、公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow S(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow S(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s\\times t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s\\times t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s\\doteq t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s\\doteq t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s&lt;t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow s&lt;t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\Rightarrow\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists,\\land,\\lor,\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\exists,\\land,\\lor,\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\to,\\forall\\)</span> 的缩写。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,A:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x&lt;t\\,A:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小子集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\">\\(s&lt;t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\forall x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\exists x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad \\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad \\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=s]=0,\\quad S(t)[x:=s]=S(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=s]=0,\\quad S(t)[x:=s]=S(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u+v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]+v[x:=s],\n\\qquad\n(u\\times v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\times v[x:=s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u+v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]+v[x:=s],\n\\qquad\n(u\\times v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\times v[x:=s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]&lt;v[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]&lt;v[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall yA\">\\(C=\\forall yA\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\Rightarrow((A_0\\to A_1),(B_0\\to B_1))\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\Rightarrow((A_0\\to A_1),(B_0\\to B_1))\\in E\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由改名与绑定改名定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundRen}\\)</span> 的定义域条件为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理与底层有界归纳\">4. 逻辑公理与底层有界归纳</h1>\n<p>定义下列七个局部公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1}=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1}=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2}=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2}=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3}=\n\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3}=\n\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1}=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1}=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2}=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2}=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}=\n\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}=\n\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基本算术与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 归纳公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}^{0}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}^{0}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\ S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\\nx+0\\doteq x,\\ x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\\nx\\times0\\doteq0,\\ x\\times S(y)\\doteq(x\\times y)+x,\\\n\\neg x&lt;0,\\ x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\ S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\\nx+0\\doteq x,\\ x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\\nx\\times0\\doteq0,\\ x\\times S(y)\\doteq(x\\times y)+x,\\\n\\neg x&lt;0,\\ x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}}=\n\\{D[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(D\\to D[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xD):\nD\\in\\Delta_0,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}}=\n\\{D[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(D\\to D[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xD):\nD\\in\\Delta_0,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-$\\Delta_0$-收集公理\">5. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 收集公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}=\n\\{\\forall a((\\forall x&lt;a\\,\\exists y\\,A)\\to\n\\exists b\\,\\forall x&lt;a\\,\\exists y(y&lt;b\\land A)):\nA\\in\\Delta_0,\\ x,y,a,b\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ |\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4,\n\\{x,y,a,b\\}\\cap\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\{a,b\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x,y\\})=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}=\n\\{\\forall a((\\forall x&lt;a\\,\\exists y\\,A)\\to\n\\exists b\\,\\forall x&lt;a\\,\\exists y(y&lt;b\\land A)):\nA\\in\\Delta_0,\\ x,y,a,b\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ |\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4,\n\\{x,y,a,b\\}\\cap\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\{a,b\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x,y\\})=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}^{\\ast}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}^{0}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}^{\\ast}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}^{0}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}^{\\ast}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}^{\\ast}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall xA_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F},\nSub_T^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},Sub_F^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\\Delta_0,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}^{\\ast},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\vdash_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F},\nSub_T^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},Sub_F^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\\Delta_0,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}^{\\ast},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}},\n\\vdash_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Coll}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只包含一阶算术句法、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 归纳、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 收集、公理集合和证明关系；不包含语义载体、赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承、模型语义或强度比较。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、公式与-$\\Delta_0$","text":"2. 项、公式与 $\\Delta_0$","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-逻辑公理与底层有界归纳","text":"4. 逻辑公理与底层有界归纳","level":1},{"id":"5.-$\\Delta_0$-收集公理","text":"5. $\\Delta_0$ 收集公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i<m\\}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\op